# Every pull request needs the repository owner's approval before it can merge.
#
# Branch protection on `main` enables "Require review from Code Owners", so this
# single rule makes @vip-ultr the required approver for all changes. Contributors
# open branches and PRs; the owner reviews and merges. The owner is exempt from
# enforcement and can merge an emergency change directly, but normal work still
# follows the PR process in CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# Order matters: the last matching pattern wins. The global rule below covers
# the entire repository. Add more specific lines above it only if ownership is
# later delegated, and keep the global fallback as the final line.

* @vip-ultr
